  "instructions": [
    "Mix flaxseed and water in a bowl, stir until a gel forms, let sit 5 minutes.",
    "Add lemon juice, soy sauce, cumin, smoked paprika, salt and pepper, stir until combined.",
    "Fold in blanched vegetables and parsley, mixing until evenly coated.",
    "Shape the mixture into small logs, about 3 inches long.",
    "Preheat a grill or grill pan to medium heat.",
    "Brush the kebabs with a little oil, grill each side for 4 minutes until firm and golden.",
    "Sprinkle sesame seeds over the kebabs during the last minute of grilling.",
    "Serve hot with a side of yogurt dip or fresh tomato salsa."
